        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>议论文模板示范笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 740px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      #fff 0px,\n      #fff 27px,\n      #cfe3f0 28px\n    );\n    background-position: 0 55px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    padding: 10px 20px 30px 55px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    color: #1b3a8f;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 27.5px;\n  }\n  .holes {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 12px;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 20px;\n  }\n  .hole {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ddd;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n  }\n  .margin-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 45px;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #e0a0a0;\n  }\n  .header-fields {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .field {\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    width: 70%;\n  }\n  .field span {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 40px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li::before {\n    content: \"●\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #1b3a8f;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .group-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 14px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  ol.items {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  ol.items li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n    text-indent: -16px;\n    margin-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .bottom-illegible {\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #3355aa;\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n  .campus-logo {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 20px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #888;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"holes\">\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top: 60px;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top: 250px;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top: 440px;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top: 630px;\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"margin-line\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-fields\">\n    <div class=\"field\"><span>No.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"field\"><span>Date</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <ul class=\"bullets\">\n    <li>从神舟一号到神舟十六号,我们\"关高地迡,览宇宙之无穷\".</li>\n    <li>鲜艳的五星红旗在浩瀚的宇宙星空中徐徐飘扬,向世人展示,我们的征途星辰大海.</li>\n    <li>九霄逐梦再问天,阔步张固新征程.</li>\n    <li>恃搅天上银河水,散作甘霖润九州.</li>\n    <li>从一张张平稳的沉稳,从容的自信的航天人面孔,窥见的是中国航天的精神鉴貌.</li>\n    <li>探索浩瀚宇宙,是梦想的远航,也是创新的跋涉.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">议论文模板示范:</div>\n\n  <div class=\"group-title\">第一组:</div>\n  <ol class=\"items\">\n    <li>1: 从\"飞天之梦\"中读懂坚定理想的赤子之心,传承\"九万里风鹏正举\"的宁定精神.</li>\n    <li>2: 从\"问天之问\"中读懂求真求知的探索之心,胸怀\"吾将上下而求索\"的开拓意识.</li>\n    <li>3: 从\"天空之切\"中读懂起而行之的进取之心,砥砺\"不破楼兰不还\"的实干担当.</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"group-title\">第二组:</div>\n  <ol class=\"items\">\n    <li>1: 学习\"特别能吃苦\"的精神,铸就\"梅花香自苦寒来\"的信念之魂,做艰苦奋斗的\"追梦人\".</li>\n    <li>2: 学习\"特别能战斗\"的精神,铸就\"千磨万击还坚韧\"的斗争之魂,做越挫越勇的\"追梦人\".</li>\n    <li>3: 学习\"特别能攻关\"的精神,铸就\"吾将上下而求索\"的创新之魂,做开拓同前的\"追梦人\".</li>\n    <li>4: 学习\"特别能奉献\"的精神,铸就\"岂因祸福避趋之\"的担当之魂,做无怨无悔的\"追梦人\".</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-illegible\">\n    [illegible] [illegible]<br>\n    [illegible] [illegible]\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"campus-logo\">Campus</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
